Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 21:20:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] Build the runner on macOS without retail dumps; extend
 suite with runner stage

- NDS_RETAIL_BIOS_BANKS option (default ON) for dump-free FreeBIOS builds
- guard live_overlay_platform.cpp for non-Windows/non-Linux targets
- suite: --runner builds the dump-free runner, boots the ROM headless,
  probes both framebuffers at 600 VBlanks
- docs: Phase 1 result and corrections

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
