+## Runner status (2026-10-09)
+
+- Builds on macOS arm64 with `-DNDS_RETAIL_BIOS_BANKS=OFF` and a
+  `recomp-ui` checkout (`github.com/mstan/recomp-ui`, set
+  `RECOMP_UI_ROOT`). Boots Rhythm Heaven to the title screen on
+  FreeBIOS + generated firmware + `--boot direct`, **entirely in Tier 3**
+  (no title banks yet). Not oracle-verified.
+- FreeBIOS has no firmware menu; G1/menu work needs the retail dumps.
+- `tools/rh_suite.py --runner --recomp-ui <dir>` reproduces this
+  (34 pass on macOS). Build outputs live in `~/dev/rh-build/`.
+- The title repo's `tools/grab_frames.py` saves both screens over the
+  documented TCP protocol; do not commit the images.
